{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the bullied minions from other games and build a leisurely village together. What's more, you'll be part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy village simulation game, you'll help the minions create a unique village and experience a relaxing pastoral life: growing crops, fishing, exploring treasures, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lucky Dice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice determine every action! Every activity\u2014planting, chopping trees, digging, stealing, and more\u2014requires a dice roll. Luck and strategy will decide the fate of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/09ae3538c02a224e5c057541685e85a7.poster.avif?t=1772625972\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/09ae3538c02a224e5c057541685e85a7.webm?t=1772625972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/09ae3538c02a224e5c057541685e85a7.mp4?t=1772625972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minion Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take in the bullied minions from other games: slimes, goblins, small skeletons... Each minion has unique skills! Craft legendary equipment for them, assign their work wisely, and maximize their potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a3c42ae450e7567aecae0a2f7d7dedb6.poster.avif?t=1772625972\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a3c42ae450e7567aecae0a2f7d7dedb6.webm?t=1772625972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/a3c42ae450e7567aecae0a2f7d7dedb6.mp4?t=1772625972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playstyle Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful shrines in different areas! Combine and match your shrines across regions to create your exclusive management playstyle! Whether you crave a bountiful harvest or striking it rich overnight from mineral veins, your strategy will define the village's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/08eda6673c38c6e1b0c5f71b1dd6f0d9.webp?t=1772625972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/08eda6673c38c6e1b0c5f71b1dd6f0d9.poster.avif?t=1772625972\" class=\"bb_img\" width=642 height=362 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Regions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and develop distinct terrains and ecosystems! Cultivate magical crops in the Fluorescent Forest, mine rare gems in the Crystal Caverns\u2014each region holds unique resources and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/4592d259517b11d2d746483f13118a4e.apng?t=1772625972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450540/extras/4592d259517b11d2d746483f13118a4e.poster.avif?t=1772625972\" class=\"bb_img\" width=642 height=362 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop Companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the village's activities in a small window and enjoy the companionship of the minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi